{
 "notes": "The policy avoids the forbidden zone passenger&fuel<4 by always keeping fuel high enough before/while carrying a passenger. With no passenger and fuel<8 it drives to the gas station first; with no passenger and fuel>=8 it drives to pickup (0,4). With a passenger and fuel<8 it drives to gas; with a passenger and fuel>=8 or at gas it drives to drop (0,0). PICK_UP only at (0,4) with fuel>=8. DROP only at (0,0) with passenger. The first hidden layer computes ReLU primitives for coordinates, fuel, and passenger. The second hidden layer combines them into mutually exclusive 0/1 case indicators. The final layer maps each case to its action with weight 10, giving a clear argmax margin.",
